{"speciesId":720,"names":{"fr":"Hoopa","es":"Hoopa","en":"Hoopa","ja":"フーパ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce fauteur de troubles est doté d’anneaux qui déforment l’espace et lui permettent d’expédier au loin n’importe quel objet."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este problemático Pokémon envía cualquier objeto a lugares remotos mediante unos anillos que deforman el espacio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This troublemaker sends anything and everything to faraway places using its loop, which can warp space."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"空間を ゆがめる リングで あらゆる ものを 離れた 場所へ 飛ばしてしまう トラブルメーカー。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a la faculté de téléporter les choses en les faisant passer au travers de ses anneaux. Il envoie les objets qui lui plaisent dans une cachette connue de lui seul."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Reúne los objetos que le atraen para esconderlos en una guarida secreta, teletransportándolos a través de sus anillos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"気に入った ものを リングを 使い 秘密の 住処へ 集めている。 リングを 潜って テレポートする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il possède une puissance considérable sous son apparence véritable. Une légende raconte qu’il désirait si fort un trésor caché dans un château qu’il déroba l’édifice tout entier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En su forma original, este Pokémon posee una fuerza descomunal. Una leyenda cuenta que una vez robó un tesoro del interior de una fortaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"In its true form, it possess a huge amount of power. Legends of its avarice tell how it once carried off an entire castle to gain the treasure hidden within."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"真の姿は 巨大な 力を 持っている。 財宝 欲しさに それが 隠された 城ごと 引き抜き 奪い去った という 伝説が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte que grâce à ses six anneaux et ses six énormes bras, il est capable de dérober tout ce qui lui plaît. Mais son pouvoir a été scellé, et il a été réduit à l’état d’un être minuscule."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que gracias a sus seis anillos y seis enormes brazos puede robar todo lo que se le antoja. Adquirió una forma reducida cuando alguien selló su poder."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It is said to be able to seize anything it desires with its six rings and six huge arms. With its power sealed, it is transformed into a much smaller form."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"６つの リングと ６つの 巨大な腕で あらゆるものを 奪うと いわれる。 力を 封じられ 小さな姿に 変えられた。"}],"varieties":[{"id":720,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",19],[17,"level-up",19],[18,"level-up",19],[25,"level-up",19],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confusion","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[15,"level-up",75],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",75],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",75],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",75],[18,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",75],[25,